    "Antes se guarda una copia de todo lo que se reescribe de Claude Code. Si algo falla, la carpeta vuelve a su sitio.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything rewritten in Claude Code’s files is backed up first. If something fails, the folder goes back where it was."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antes se guarda una copia de todo lo que se reescribe. La carpeta del disco no se toca.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything that’s rewritten is backed up first. The folder on disk isn’t touched."
